{"2701080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Intoxicated Driver", "steam_appid": 2701080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete against friends in various drinking and driving related party game modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become (or stay as) an alcoholic and try to avoid the cops while competing to get as drunk as possible. Or be the cop and arrest your friends for breaking the law…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/a720e1f579b9b9192132b723dd01150e.poster.avif?t=1774364430\" width=700 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/a720e1f579b9b9192132b723dd01150e.webm?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/a720e1f579b9b9192132b723dd01150e.mp4?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race against friends, or the clock, where drinking is mandatory for all racers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/6e5061be3aadd8aa78708e35960ff4c2.poster.avif?t=1774364430\" width=700 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/6e5061be3aadd8aa78708e35960ff4c2.webm?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/6e5061be3aadd8aa78708e35960ff4c2.mp4?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordinate with your team to capture the opponents flag, but beware, the longer the flag is held, the more drunk you become.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/4420a60ec35652e004246e8b471c9e6d.avif?t=1774364430\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And MANY more gamemodes, including Pedestrians, Little VS Big, Bombs, Deadly Lines, Simon Says, and Hot Potato! (with more gamemodes coming soon)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your car with hundreds of combinations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/cccd515fa1ce0a71cadb45cf8a45dafc.poster.avif?t=1774364430\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/cccd515fa1ce0a71cadb45cf8a45dafc.webm?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/cccd515fa1ce0a71cadb45cf8a45dafc.mp4?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Settings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus in game settings to spice up your drunk driving experience (like powerups, thick fog, instant kill, infinite boosts/jumps, etc).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no cap to party size, there is no reason to not drink and drive with your friends (or people in online lobbies)!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete against friends in various drinking and driving related party game modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become (or stay as) an alcoholic and try to avoid the cops while competing to get as drunk as possible. Or be the cop and arrest your friends for breaking the law…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/a720e1f579b9b9192132b723dd01150e.poster.avif?t=1774364430\" width=700 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/a720e1f579b9b9192132b723dd01150e.webm?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/a720e1f579b9b9192132b723dd01150e.mp4?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race against friends, or the clock, where drinking is mandatory for all racers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/6e5061be3aadd8aa78708e35960ff4c2.poster.avif?t=1774364430\" width=700 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/6e5061be3aadd8aa78708e35960ff4c2.webm?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/6e5061be3aadd8aa78708e35960ff4c2.mp4?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordinate with your team to capture the opponents flag, but beware, the longer the flag is held, the more drunk you become.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/4420a60ec35652e004246e8b471c9e6d.avif?t=1774364430\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And MANY more gamemodes, including Pedestrians, Little VS Big, Bombs, Deadly Lines, Simon Says, and Hot Potato! (with more gamemodes coming soon)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your car with hundreds of combinations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/cccd515fa1ce0a71cadb45cf8a45dafc.poster.avif?t=1774364430\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/cccd515fa1ce0a71cadb45cf8a45dafc.webm?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/extras/cccd515fa1ce0a71cadb45cf8a45dafc.mp4?t=1774364430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Settings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus in game settings to spice up your drunk driving experience (like powerups, thick fog, instant kill, infinite boosts/jumps, etc).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no cap to party size, there is no reason to not drink and drive with your friends (or people in online lobbies)!</p>", "short_description": "Get ready to drink and drive (safely). Challenge friends in multiple drinking and driving game modes, like drunk cop chases, pedestrians, races, capture the flag, hot potato, and more! With options to change the style of play, there is so much drunk driving fun!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/header.jpg?t=1774364430", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701080/8bdaed959a5f2673e0e95ba5512a36